  "notes": "USAGE:\nDescribes a stable personality trait rather than a temporary mood. Often used with な to modify nouns.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {恥|は}ずかしがり{屋|や} emphasizes being easily embarrassed\n- {人見知|ひとみし}り specifically refers to shyness around strangers\n- {内気|うちき} is the most general term for an introverted, quiet personality\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {内気|うちき}な{性格|せいかく} (shy personality)\n- {内気|うちき}な{子|こ} (a shy child)",
